{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51110","headline":"石峰（原注：中和甲辰年冬十月，奉使东泛，泊舟於大珠山下。凡所入目，命爲篇名，啸月吟风，贮成十首寄高员外。） · 崔致远","name":"石峰（原注：中和甲辰年冬十月，奉使东泛，泊舟於大珠山下。凡所入目，命爲篇名，啸月吟风，贮成十首寄高员外。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巉岩绝顶欲摩天，海日初开一朶莲。\n势削不容凡树木，格高唯惹好云烟。\n点苏寒影粧新雪，戞玉清音喷细泉。\n静想蓬莱只如此，应当月夜会羣仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}